<description>&lt;p&gt;The Indigenous Guard has taken up arms against President De la Espriella after a fifth bombing killed nine ELN members and a separate army bombing killed eight ELN fighters in the southwest. A car bomb at Casanare toll booths injured four women, while a drone strike in Guapi, Cauca killed one Marine and wounded four soldiers. Ten ELN fighters were killed in a strike in Cauca, and ten rebels from the ELN were killed in a separate incident. Viviane Morales has been reappointed to De la Espriella’s government and Mocho Olmedo, head of Front 33, was extradited to the United States. 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPZlNzNUVOUHAyRWszSFZIUVd3cnhSalNPVGFIRUZhYUc1c1JldTRFYWRJSy05Z0ZEeEk0MjlxZ0o3Z3FVRTRtTnB5dzl5VE1NTXpUY2FVajRsRTJCOWpnZ052SXczN1E4c0JRZS1lcmZCR3hydXpJSEFqTjlqSkp0bTVqcXc1UQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxOY3k4cHo0TV9FUUFleHZFQUVHTkZZUDZ5STZqbm1VMW1kdlRtcVI3bjlvcjVTWVlKblo4N1JlTlNuTXlBWjVNWUV3eHM3ejc3c2xERzFadnFFRFBLbnZvWUxXNy15TVkta25ONTVzaHp3N2hhTHdld2x3bFVtUWNiZjd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNYm1IREhMVjNYczVEVkgzT0JPSzg5UVRoWW9lTzZkV2x1QXV5TUl2WWI3LUVVSjlfbVpRMFo2SU52RXpSSXRxRHJNMHA3OGl2Z3JTZi1BMW1DQ0MyUy00a0JZdzhHRXF0MS0yOTBkZndnc01YdF83VzlpNzhDOENvSWE5UnJOOXFXVEV6VlBzTzRkZk9YRWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yahoo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxOV0NvbzNQaDgxMjFLZUJoLUxHOVdlaUhvMmN4YW1GdEo4QTdrMS1TV2pjU0xLZEk4bS1WTnZzYVg1Y2tGVktWc0xWMDNDZ1owMDFxQ2lJVXhGcW5VTlpFaVplSHEwbUtWbGVLdmFPdlRHNDEzd2h2STJwb29LTmdRRW12QXZmX3pqU3JIRjFsRHVkT3pLSFlCaVFyQnpjcHpCVjRYNy1XT051X0M1djZrSkI0Q3NKVzg?oc=5&quot;&gt;UA.NEWS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt